1
00:00:00,420 --> 00:00:01,680
Kya tumhe bhi yahi lagta hai?

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:03,050
Python language ka naam

3
00:00:03,120 --> 00:00:05,900
Python snake se relate
karte hue rakha hai?

4
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:08,200
But ye kahin bhi
sahi nahi hai.

5
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,350
Baat thi 1989 ki.

6
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:12,510
Jahan par ek researcher
Guido van Rossum

7
00:00:12,550 --> 00:00:14,030
ek aisi language chahta tha

8
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:16,150
joki C se zyada
fast ho, simple ho.

9
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:19,000
Wahi usi time apni
Christmas ki chuttiyon mein

10
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:21,200
ek hobby project
start karta hai.

11
00:00:21,180 --> 00:00:22,440
Jismein wo decide karta hai,

12
00:00:22,480 --> 00:00:24,240
Main ek aisi language
par work karunga

13
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:27,420
joki C se zyada fast
ho aur efficient ho.

14
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,400
Aur usne is language
ka naam rakha

15
00:00:29,470 --> 00:00:31,900
ek British comedy show se
relate karte hue joki tha,

16
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,050
Monty Python's Flying Circus.

17
00:00:34,170 --> 00:00:36,730
Isi ke naam par usne apni
language ka naam rakha

18
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:37,350
Python.

19
00:00:37,470 --> 00:00:40,190
Ye Python language ek itna
bada invention hai, joki

20
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:40,950
machine learning,

21
00:00:40,950 --> 00:00:42,500
artificial intelligence,

22
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:44,400
automation jaise sectors mein

23
00:00:44,520 --> 00:00:46,340
kaafi important
role play karti hai.

24
00:00:46,390 --> 00:00:49,010
Socho, ek us purane time
ka chhota sa invention,

25
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:50,220
jiski wajah se,

26
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:52,180
aaj kitna bada
ecosystem ban chuka hai.
